!!id:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/meta-kernel-resolved.tn"
@doc:"""
  Resolver-output fixture for meta-kernel.tn (2026 Revision 39 draft).
  Parse the source schema, run the resolver, canonicalise, compare.

  A resolved form's header is its source's, and the kernel imports nothing,
  so this one carries its `!!id` alone and is read under the pre-loaded
  kernel. Nothing in the document marks it resolved; a processor reads it
  as a resolved form because its caller says so ([TSON-SCHEMA] Section
  8.1).

  Conventions:
  - Every entry is its value: a name maps to the body it resolves
    to, `!record { ... }`, `!integer_type { ... }`, `!alias { ... }`,
    `!template { ... }`. Output is source with sugar
    expanded, bodies flattened and chains computed, and an entry
    written as a constructor application resolves to itself.
  - Fields at their default values are omitted (`optional: false`,
    `voidable: false`, `role: FREE`), and so are empty chains.
  - A type body carries `type`'s one field, `chain`, a `type_chain`.
    `supertypes` is the complete IS-A chain, every element a bare
    name, closed to a fixed point through applied parents; `subtypes`
    is its inverse over the entries of this map only (inverse edges
    from schemas that import this one are not represented here);
    `parents` is a record template's, the parents as written. Both
    name lists are written lexically sorted; a resolver's native
    ordering is implementation-defined, so comparison tools
    canonicalise both lists before comparing. Set-typed fields are
    compared as written, in source declaration order (Part 2
    Sections 7.5, 8). An empty chain is omitted.
  - An `!alias` and a `!template` compose `top` and carry no
    chain.
  - A record's `fields` are flattened: a composition's fields are
    its operands' and its own, merged, so every record composing
    `type` (through `atom`, `product` or `sum`) states `chain` among
    its fields first.
  - `top`, `type` and the three base kinds are `abstract`, so each
    states `extension: ABSTRACT`.
  - Source annotations are preserved in their authored positions,
    except `@doc`: a conforming resolver carries every source @doc
    verbatim, and these fixtures, which exist to be compared, leave
    entry docs out and substitute this conventions note for the
    document-level one.
  - Alias-kind names at type positions are stated as written: an
    alias is a hop, not a rewrite, so a use site naming an alias
    names the alias. A processor collapses the chain when it compiles
    readers, after linking, not in resolved output.
  - A slot that names a type (`record_field.type`,
    `tuple_element.element_type`, a container's type slots, choice
    variants, a parameter's `type` and `bound`) is typed `type_kind`,
    the kind of the types, and holds a bare name: a type's name,
    judged a member of the kind when the schema links. An
    application is a reference with an argument list, written
    unquoted in its canonical text, `result<T>`: no whitespace, and
    one space between arguments. A closed one lifts to an entry and is
    named bare, so one stands only where an application is still
    open: a record template's `parents` and field types, held text,
    and the `application` annotation.
  - The container constructors carry no parameters: their type
    slots are plain required `type_kind`-typed fields, filled by the
    construction (or by a sugar form's desugaring) like any other
    required field. Within a template body `value` also carries a
    parameter, unlabelled: a token there is a parameter exactly when
    its text resolves into the enclosing entry's `parameters`
    (Part 2 Section 5.10's shadowing rule), and a closed entry has
    none for one to resolve into. A parametric `= P` is FIXED and
    `~ P` DEFAULT where it is written, the parameter in `value`;
    materialisation substitutes the argument into `value` and changes
    no other fact, and `optional` is the name's mark as written
    (Part 2 Section 5.7).
  - An argument is a reference or a token, positional against the
    head's parameters and typed where it lands: in a template body a
    parameter of either kind stands as its name, read against
    `parameters`.
  - An open entry is one of two values (Part 2 Sections 5.10, 8.1).
    A record template is a `!record` with `parameters`, read as the
    vocabulary and not held: a parameter stands at a field's type, a
    field's value or an application's argument, and its `chain`
    holds `parents` as written, one of which may be an application.
    Every other open entry is held: a `!template` carrying its
    `parameters` and, as text in `template`, the constructor
    application as written — a container as
    `!array`/`!map`/`!tuple`/`!choice`, an atom constructor as
    `!integer_type`, an alias as `!alias` — unread until
    materialisation substitutes the parameters away. An entry that
    closes a template application carries the derived `@application`
    at its schema-map key, the application it is the instantiation
    of, read as stated on ingest; none appear here, as nothing in
    this schema applies a non-constructor template.
  - Synthetic entries — the closed forms the sugar lifts to (Part 2
    Section 5.3) — are instances of the constructor they build, are
    referenced by the field that wrote the sugar, and carry the
    derived `@synthetic` marker at their schema-map keys (Part 2
    Sections 6, 8.2); on ingest the marker is discarded and
    recomputed. Their internal names here follow the
    convention `<constructor>_<operands>_xxhash`, where the trailing
    `xxhash` is a placeholder for a content hash of the resolved
    binding record: the *shape* of the data — one internally named,
    `@synthetic`-marked entry per distinct concrete form — is the
    conformance point; the hash spelling is an implementation's own
    business and the placeholder is deliberately not a real digest.
  - Bare parameter names (e.g. T) in bodies are read against the
    enclosing entry's `parameters` list.
  """
!schema {
  top => !record {
    chain: {
      subtypes: [alias array atom choice declared_type enum enum_type identifier_type integer_type iri_type map namespace product record reference regex_type set_type sum template text_type tuple type value_type void_type]
    }
    fields: {}
    extension: ABSTRACT
  }

  type_chain => !record { fields: {
    parents    => !record_field { type: array_type_kind_xxhash  optional: true }
    supertypes => !record_field { type: array_type_kind_xxhash  optional: true }
    subtypes   => !record_field { type: array_type_kind_xxhash  optional: true }
  } }

  type => !record {
    chain: {
      supertypes: [top]
      subtypes: [array atom choice declared_type enum enum_type identifier_type integer_type iri_type map namespace product record reference regex_type set_type sum text_type tuple value_type void_type]
    }
    fields: {
      chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    }
    extension: ABSTRACT
  }

  atom => !record {
    chain: {
      supertypes: [top type]
      subtypes: [enum enum_type identifier_type integer_type iri_type reference regex_type text_type value_type void_type]
    }
    fields: {
      chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    }
    extension: ABSTRACT
  }

  product => !record { chain: { supertypes: [top type]  subtypes: [array map namespace record set_type tuple] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type }
  }  extension: ABSTRACT }

  sum => !record { chain: { supertypes: [top type]  subtypes: [choice declared_type] }  fields: {
    chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
  }  extension: ABSTRACT }

  namespace => !record { chain: { supertypes: [product top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: NAMED }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: VARIABLE }
    key_type       => !record_field { type: identifier_kind  optional: true }
    value_type     => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    ordered        => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
  } }

  alias => !record { chain: { supertypes: [top] }  fields: {
    target => !record_field { type: type_kind }
  } }

  template_param => !record { fields: {
    name  => !record_field { type: param_name }
    type  => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    bound => !record_field { type: type_kind  optional: true }
  } }

  template => !record { chain: { supertypes: [top] }  fields: {
    parameters => !record_field { type: array_template_param_xxhash }
    template   => !record_field { type: text }
  } }

  value_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom top type] }  fields: {
    chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
  } }

  value => !value_type {}

  void_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom top type] }  fields: {
    chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
  } }

  void => !void_type {}

  boolean => !enum { members: [true false] }

  integer_size => !record { fields: {
    bits   => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer }
    signed => !record_field { type: boolean }
  } }

  integer_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom top type] }  fields: {
    chain         => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    size          => !record_field { type: integer_size  optional: true }
    min           => !record_field { type: integer  optional: true }
    exclusive_min => !record_field { type: integer  optional: true }
    max           => !record_field { type: integer  optional: true }
    exclusive_max => !record_field { type: integer  optional: true }
    multiple_of   => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    members       => !record_field { type: integer_member_set  optional: true }
  }
  groups: [
    !field_group { members: [[min] [exclusive_min]]  optional: true }
    !field_group { members: [[max] [exclusive_max]]  optional: true }
  ] }

  integer => !integer_type { chain: { subtypes: [non_negative_integer] } }

  text_member_set => !set_type { element_type: text  min_items: 1 }

  text_type => !record {
    chain: { supertypes: [atom top type]  subtypes: [identifier_type iri_type regex_type] }
    fields: {
    chain         => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    min_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    length        => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    pattern       => !record_field { type: regex    optional: true }
    members       => !record_field { type: text_member_set  optional: true }
    normalization => !record_field { type: normalization  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: NONE }
  } }

  text => !text_type {}

  atom_specification => !record { chain: { subtypes: [identifier_type iri_type regex_type] }  fields: {
    spec => !record_field { type: iri }
  } }

  identifier_base => !enum { members: [XID ID ASCII NONE] }

  normalization => !enum { members: [NONE NFC NFKC NFKC_CASEFOLD ASCII_CASEFOLD] }

  identifier_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom atom_specification text_type top type] }  fields: {
    chain         => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    min_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    length        => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    pattern       => !record_field { type: regex    optional: true }
    members       => !record_field { type: text_member_set  optional: true }
    normalization => !record_field { type: normalization  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: NFC }
    spec          => !record_field { type: iri   optional: true  role: FIXED  value: "https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/" }
    start         => !record_field { type: identifier_base  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: XID }
    continue      => !record_field { type: identifier_base  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: XID }
    start_add     => !record_field { type: text  optional: true }
    continue_add  => !record_field { type: text  optional: true }
    medial        => !record_field { type: text  optional: true }
    exclude       => !record_field { type: text  optional: true }
  } }

  identifier => !identifier_type { continue_add: "-" }

  iri_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom atom_specification text_type top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    min_length     => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_length     => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    length         => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    pattern        => !record_field { type: regex    optional: true }
    members        => !record_field { type: text_member_set  optional: true }
    normalization  => !record_field { type: normalization  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: NONE }
    spec           => !record_field { type: iri      optional: true  role: FIXED  value: "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3987" }
    schemes        => !record_field { type: scheme_set  optional: true }
    allow_relative => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: true }
    allow_fragment => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: true }
  } }

  scheme_set => !set_type { element_type: scheme_name  min_items: 1 }

  scheme_name => !identifier_type { start: ASCII  continue: ASCII  continue_add: "+-."  exclude: "_"  normalization: ASCII_CASEFOLD }

  iri => !iri_type { allow_relative: false }

  regex_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom atom_specification text_type top type] }  fields: {
    chain         => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    min_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_length    => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    length        => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    pattern       => !record_field { type: regex  optional: true }
    members       => !record_field { type: text_member_set  optional: true }
    normalization => !record_field { type: normalization  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: NONE }
    spec          => !record_field { type: iri  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9485" }
  } }

  regex => !regex_type {}

  type_name => !alias { target: identifier }

  field_name => !alias { target: identifier }

  param_name => !alias { target: identifier }

  product_access_type => !enum { members: [INDEX NAMED] }

  product_size_type => !enum { members: [FIXED VARIABLE] }

  field_role => !enum { members: [FREE DEFAULT FIXED] }

  record_extension_type => !enum { members: [ABSTRACT FINAL OPEN] }

  annotation => !alias { target: void }

  doc => @annotation !alias { target: text }

  synthetic => @annotation !alias { target: void }

  application => @annotation !alias { target: type_kind }

  record_field => !record { fields: {
    type     => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    optional => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    voidable => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    role     => !record_field { type: field_role  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: FREE }
    value    => !record_field { type: value  optional: true }
  } }

  tuple_element => !record { fields: {
    element_type => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    voidable     => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
  } }

  field_group => !record { fields: {
    members          => !record_field { type: array_array_text_1_3600e7d5_1_xxhash }
    optional_members => !record_field { type: array_text_1_xxhash  optional: true }
    optional         => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
  } }

  field_map => !namespace { value_type: record_field  ordered: true }

  record => !record { chain: { supertypes: [product top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: NAMED }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: FIXED }
    fields         => !record_field { type: field_map }
    groups         => !record_field { type: array_field_group_xxhash  optional: true }
    extension      => !record_field { type: record_extension_type  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: OPEN }
    discriminators => !record_field { type: array_text_1_xxhash  optional: true }
    name_type      => !record_field { type: identifier_kind  optional: true }
    parameters     => !record_field { type: array_template_param_xxhash  optional: true }
  } }

  array => !record { chain: { supertypes: [product top type]  subtypes: [set_type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: INDEX }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: VARIABLE }
    element_type   => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    voidable       => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    ordered        => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: true }
    unique_items   => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    min_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
  } }

  set_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [array product top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: INDEX }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: VARIABLE }
    element_type   => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    voidable       => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: false }
    ordered        => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: false }
    unique_items   => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: true }
    min_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
  } }
  map => !record { chain: { supertypes: [product top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: NAMED }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: VARIABLE }
    key_type       => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    value_type     => !record_field { type: type_kind }
    voidable       => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    ordered        => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true  role: DEFAULT  value: false }
    min_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
    max_items      => !record_field { type: non_negative_integer  optional: true }
  } }

  tuple => !record { chain: { supertypes: [product top type] }  fields: {
    chain          => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    access_pattern => !record_field { type: product_access_type  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: INDEX }
    size_type      => !record_field { type: product_size_type    optional: true  role: FIXED  value: FIXED }
    elements       => !record_field { type: array_tuple_element_xxhash }
  } }

  enum_set => !set_type { element_type: text  min_items: 1 }

  non_negative_integer => !integer_type { chain: { supertypes: [integer] }  min: 0 }

  integer_member_set => !set_type { element_type: integer  min_items: 1 }

  enum_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom top type]  subtypes: [enum] }  fields: {
    chain     => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    name_type => !record_field { type: identifier_kind }
    members   => !record_field { type: enum_set }
  } }

  enum => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom enum_type top type] }  fields: {
    chain     => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    name_type => !record_field { type: identifier_kind  optional: true  role: FIXED  value: identifier }
    members   => !record_field { type: enum_set }
  } }

  choice => !record { chain: { supertypes: [sum top type] }  fields: {
    chain    => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    variants => !record_field { type: array_type_kind_xxhash }
    disjoint => !record_field { type: boolean  optional: true }
  } }

  declared_type => !record { chain: { supertypes: [sum top type] }  fields: {
    chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
  } }

  declared => !declared_type {}

  reference => !record { chain: { supertypes: [atom top type] }  fields: {
    chain => !record_field { type: type_chain  optional: true }
    of    => !record_field { type: type_kind }
  } }

  kind => !template { parameters: [{ name: T  type: type_kind }]  template: "!reference { of: T }" }

  identifier_kind => !reference { of: identifier_type }

  atom_kind => !reference { of: atom }

  type_kind => !reference { of: type }

  ref => !template { parameters: [{ name: T  type: type_kind }]  template: "!reference { of: T }" }

  schema => !namespace { key_type: type_name  value_type: declared }

  @synthetic array_template_param_xxhash => !array { element_type: template_param }

  @synthetic array_type_kind_xxhash => !array { element_type: type_kind }

  @synthetic array_array_text_1_3600e7d5_1_xxhash => !array { element_type: array_text_1_xxhash  min_items: 1 }

  @synthetic array_text_1_xxhash => !array { element_type: text  min_items: 1 }

  @synthetic array_field_group_xxhash => !array { element_type: field_group }

  @synthetic array_tuple_element_xxhash => !array { element_type: tuple_element }
}
